    <!-- one-vocabulary 4.1/15.11, D31: the same words as iOS's settings.reset.body, broken
         into two paragraphs here. SourceDetail.swift records why iOS keeps one: a confirmation
         body that stopped at "No files" at the largest text size does not scroll, so the blank
         line is not free there. A presentation difference, not a wording one. -->
